    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "GVM Auctioneers are delighted to introduce to the market this modern and spacious three-bedroom semi-detached family home, ideally situated within a mature and established residential development just a five-minute walk from Kilmallock town centre and its wide range of local amenities.\n\nPresented in excellent condition throughout, this attractive property offers bright, well-proportioned and comfortable accommodation. The ground floor comprises a welcoming entrance hall, a spacious sitting room and a generous kitchen/dining area, ideal for both everyday family living and entertaining. Upstairs, there are three well-appointed bedrooms, including a master bedroom with ensuite, along with a main family bathroom.\n.\nThe front garden has an open plan lawn and two car parking spaces with pedestrian entrance gate to access the rear garden. Enclosed rear garden, offering privacy and laid out in lawn with patio area and steel tech garden shed.\n\nStanding on a generous site with excellent potential for future extension, this property enjoys a peaceful and family-friendly setting while remaining just a short walk from Kilmallock town and all its amenities. The established residential surroundings provide a wonderful balance of convenience, privacy and tranquillity\n\nEarly viewing is highly recommended to fully appreciate all that this property has to offer.\n\nFor further information or to arrange a viewing, contact Richard Ryan on 087 8067772.\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Entrance Hall - 12'10\" (3.91m) x 5'10\" (1.78m)\nWith tiled floor\n\nSitting Room - 13'0\" (3.96m) x 12'6\" (3.81m)\nWith laminated wood floor, feature fireplace & bay window.\n\nKitchen/Dining Room - 18'9\" (5.72m) x 12'0\" (3.66m)\nWith fitted units containing ample storage, tiled floor, tiled splash back.\n\nBathroom - 5'6\" (1.68m) x 6'6\" (1.98m)\nTiled with; toilet, bath and wash hand basin.\n\nBedroom No. 1 - 11'9\" (3.58m) x 9'6\" (2.9m)\nWith solid wooden floor.\n\nBedroom No. 2 - 11'11\" (3.63m) x 11'9\" (3.58m)\nWith solid wooden floor.\n\nEnsuite - 8'8\" (2.64m) x 3'0\" (0.91m)\nFully tiled with toilet, wash hand basin and Triton electric shower.\n\nBedroom No. 3 - 8'0\" (2.44m) x 8'0\" (2.44m)\nWith solid wooden floor.\n\nNotice\nPlease note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> Oil fired central heating. </li><li> DG PVC Windows. </li><li> Mains Services. </li><li> Walking distance of town centre. </li><li> BER C.</li></ul>"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "BER Details",
        "SortOrder": 4,
        "Content": "BER: C<br>BER No: 103643466<br>Energy Performance Indicator: 173.86 kWh/m2/yr"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Directions",
        "SortOrder": 5,
        "Content": "Heading in the direction of Bruff from Kilmallock turn left at the church, proceed for 250 meters and turn right into Sycamore Drive. Co-ordinates: 52.40406546537745, -8.581217398887453 or alternatively use Eircode V35 HX67."
      },
      {
